e desenvolvido a penicilina como um tratamento pr\u00e1tico.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae0c-7cf0-986b-d193ce88fbee","description":"Alexander Fleming","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae0c-7b52-b276-7570af7c495b","description":"Louis Pasteur","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae0c-7914-bed8-5ce6047f7e99","description":"Frederick Sanger","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae0c-788a-bfe7-3b3ec9d0df00","description":"John Dalton","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae0c-7310-a32b-ffcae3d13a09","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 outro termo para \u201cmastigar\u201d?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Mastigar divide os alimentos em peda\u00e7os menores e os mistura com a saliva; engolir leva os alimentos para a garganta, enquanto a digest\u00e3o \u00e9 o processo mais amplo de decompor os alimentos.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae0c-7f9a-988f-aa3a876ddf5c","description":"Mastiga\u00e7\u00e3o","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae0c-73f2-b1de-df2ee41a2124","description":"Engolir","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae0c-7263-a6ed-adc53112cae8","description":"Digest\u00e3o","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae0c-7cae-9df8-033db16c3344","description":"Saliva\u00e7\u00e3o","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae0c-7500-a0bb-3c25dfd576d5","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Como voc\u00ea chamaria uma elefanta?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Uma \u201ccow\u201d \u00e9 uma elefanta adulta; os machos s\u00e3o chamados de \u201cbulls\u201d, e os filhotes de elefante s\u00e3o chamados de \u201ccalves\u201d.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae0c-70e4-af9e-73f23b920079","description":"Uma vaca","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae0c-7458-b81e-7f3e39e55e0e","description":"Uma porca","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae0c-7099-8226-c053134fb67c","description":"Uma cor\u00e7a","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae0c-7622-8297-46e30e7e3f14","description":"Um curral","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae0c-76c8-bdaa-bbc0b2d5fbcf","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual ordem de insetos \u00e9 chamada de Lepidoptera?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"As borboletas e as mariposas comp\u00f5em a ordem Lepidoptera, nome derivado de palavras gregas que significam \u201cescama\u201d e \u201casa\u201d, em refer\u00eancia \u00e0s escamas presentes em suas asas.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae0c-7662-b315-440edbd6b0ec","description":"Borboletas e mariposas","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae0c-7904-952b-0a10351fbdb4","description":"Besouros","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae0c-78b2-a259-093e9fa9b1fe","description":"Lib\u00e9lulas","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae0c-74b4-8674-7bd19e381ea2","description":"Abelhas e vespas","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae0c-769f-8de9-10b22a5d5177","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 o m\u00ednimo m\u00faltiplo comum de 22 e 44?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"44 \u00e9 divis\u00edvel por 22, portanto j\u00e1 \u00e9 um m\u00faltiplo de ambos os n\u00fameros; nenhum n\u00famero positivo menor pode ser um m\u00faltiplo comum.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae0c-7cba-bbf6-9dec71f4da31","description":"44","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae0c-771d-9813-bae8e40e1385","description":"22","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae0c-7dae-b6c3-4d36efcb7133","description":"66","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae0c-7755-9c50-8fa57c4701ab","description":"88","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae0c-7ccf-bb15-6ec14c674d70","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Na astronomia, qual \u00e9 o termo usado para medir o brilho das estrelas?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"A magnitude aparente mede o brilho de uma estrela visto da Terra; ao contr\u00e1rio da magnitude absoluta, ela depende tanto da luminosidade intr\u00ednseca da estrela quanto de sua dist\u00e2ncia.