 valores diferentes da raiz quadrada de 144?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Os dois valores s\u00e3o 12 e -12. O s\u00edmbolo \u221a144 denota apenas a raiz principal positiva, mas a resolu\u00e7\u00e3o da equa\u00e7\u00e3o x\u00b2 = 144 fornece ambos os valores.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-77c5-97a3-628f75f68bbf","description":"12 e -12","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-7b7c-8ea0-6572f7b5d554","description":"144 e -144","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-79c7-9952-fecf94cf65cc","description":"24 e -24","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-79ed-abf5-fa50b6fac50d","description":"12 e 24","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-7aad-b161-9c1623c74a29","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que a angiologia estuda?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"A angiologia abrange as redes sangu\u00ednea e linf\u00e1tica do corpo, e n\u00e3o apenas o cora\u00e7\u00e3o.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-7b3c-a0fa-afdc1dfe7601","description":"Sistemas vasculares","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-7e7d-a53c-ad92e9e49a47","description":"Quebra-cabe\u00e7as","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-705f-b8e8-445dc0409a5d","description":"Movimentos ondulat\u00f3rios","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-7402-a217-ee2e031aa372","description":"Os registros dos an\u00e9is das \u00e1rvores","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-7a39-83b2-3be5d2cfdc50","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Quem desenvolveu a vacina contra a var\u00edola?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Edward Jenner utilizou a var\u00edola bovina para proteger as pessoas contra a var\u00edola, sendo pioneiro na vacina\u00e7\u00e3o; a palavra deriva do latim \u201cvacca\u201d, que significa vaca.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-7dae-9df9-9bf3b8031b5f","description":"Edward Jenner","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-7951-aae0-e20203e1d0e0","description":"Francis Crick","correct_answer":fa