cGander\u201d","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-7bc3-93f8-5ee39000df2f","description":"Uma ovelha","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-7962-a46b-88f635c816a5","description":"Uma porca","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-780c-9eb9-e6792c1f4377","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 a fun\u00e7\u00e3o do p\u00e2ncreas?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"O p\u00e2ncreas libera insulina e glucagon para ajudar a controlar o n\u00edvel de a\u00e7\u00facar no sangue, e suas enzimas ajudam a digerir gorduras, prote\u00ednas e carboidratos.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-758d-bcee-9d3f2e5ae508","description":"Secreta horm\u00f4nios e enzimas digestivas","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-7f82-8e2a-4236e88cedf0","description":"Controla a temperatura corporal","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-7365-8016-fda85f2547ea","description":"Filtra o sangue","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-703b-a7d0-d551654f8f79","description":"Produz oxig\u00eanio","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-78e6-8293-7d964fece24c","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 a palavra para designar um grupo de gaivotas?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"\u201cCol\u00f4nia\u201d \u00e9 um termo comum para designar um grupo de gaivotas em per\u00edodo de reprodu\u00e7\u00e3o, que costumam fazer seus ninhos pr\u00f3ximos uns dos outros.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-76dc-a03f-62d01b63301b","description":"Uma col\u00f4nia","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-7eee-a673-3df9ee731d88","description":"Um bando","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-7284-8bad-e67f935ec619","description":"Um grupo","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-702a-8ede-10632fa4f5fa","description":"Um grupo","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-763c-ae2a-8ea95d888d1e","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Como voc\u00ea chamaria um filhote de fur\u00e3o?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Um \u201ckit\u201d \u00e9 um filhote de fur\u00e3o. Os filhotes rec\u00e9m-nascidos v\u00eam ao mundo com os olhos e as orelhas fechados.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-7a32-b438-cc6ec6983852","description":"Um filhote","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-7c24-ba69-91a98af93e56","description":"Um filhote de canguru","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-7798-9e57-5b14cbfc7305","description":"Uma \u00e1guia filhote","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-7e40-8420-8ef3528e2694","description":"Uma lava","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-72b1-9916-e2777e2b98dd","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Para que serve o hipoclorito de s\u00f3dio, subst\u00e2ncia qu\u00edmica frequentemente utilizada?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"O hipoclorito de s\u00f3dio \u00e9 o princ\u00edpio ativo da \u00e1gua sanit\u00e1ria dom\u00e9stica; sua a\u00e7\u00e3o oxidante ajuda a decompor compostos coloridos e a eliminar micr\u00f3bios.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-7169-a2d4-e283170e2ab0","description":"\u00c9 utilizado para a limpeza de superf\u00edcies, clareamento, remo\u00e7\u00e3o de odores e desinfec\u00e7\u00e3o da \u00e1gua.","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-785e-baa3-244b79742d85","description":"\u00c9 utilizado como ingrediente na produ\u00e7\u00e3o de vidro, tijolos e cer\u00e2mica.","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-7458-932a-5dfa8e6abc31","description":"\u00c9 utilizado na fabrica\u00e7\u00e3o de placas de gesso.","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-755e-8c51-f5dcd86f48b6","description":"\u00c9 utilizado para aliviar dores e inflama\u00e7\u00f5es.","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-7a9e-a751-c8b7b6c95b80","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que causa a tens\u00e3o superficial da \u00e1gua?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"A coes\u00e3o intermolecular exerce uma for\u00e7a l\u00edquida volta