ription":"Atmosfera","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-77a6-aa39-6c49e3ae932c","description":"Hidrosfera","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-7d81-8e74-3d9fd3433c56","description":"Biosfera","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-7031-86e3-1baf0facf8b9","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que a semiologia estuda?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"A semiologia estuda como os signos transmitem significado na comunica\u00e7\u00e3o e na cultura; o termo \u00e9 frequentemente usado de forma intercambi\u00e1vel com \u201csemi\u00f3tica\u201d.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-76e4-8573-aa9feb5d9642","description":"sinais","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-7174-9e94-58fe68deaded","description":"trata-se de materiais terrestres que podem ser utilizados para fins econ\u00f4micos e\/ou industriais","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-7cbd-b2a0-a21fb32f00a3","description":"a pr\u00e1tica de escapar de restri\u00e7\u00f5es ou outras armadilhas","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-728f-a9e2-a7a7848b14ab","description":"um ramo da l\u00f3gica que se concentra nas rela\u00e7\u00f5es entre partes e o todo","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-7652-8e98-5228782d60fe","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que a enologia estuda?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Enologia tamb\u00e9m \u00e9 escrita como oenologia; o termo deriva da palavra grega oinos, que significa vinho.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-7df4-a6d3-5e02bb0c8e23","description":"Vinho e vinifica\u00e7\u00e3o","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-7417-b430-4313014bc88e","description":"Baleias, golfinhos e botos","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-7b18-932b-77a689aa9768","description":"Coisas nojentas e repugnantes","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-728f-9e7a-b7fae6911f8a","description":"Tibete","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-77ec-8c70-7bb246838503","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Na geometria, qual \u00e9 o oposto de um \u00e2ngulo agudo?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Um \u00e2ngulo obtuso mede mais de 90 graus, mas menos de 180 graus; um \u00e2ngulo agudo mede menos de 90 graus.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-7d1e-a290-8cca29218c57","description":"Obtuso","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-7ea7-bd56-eb0185327d13","description":"Cr\u00f4nico","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-721f-b690-5ee82329aa0d","description":"Vetor","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-71d6-aa8f-0cc7a443bd0e","description":"Integral","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-7780-8969-053ddd9bb3b7","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Como voc\u00ea chamaria um filhote de lebre?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Um filhote de lebre nasce com pelos e os olhos abertos, ao contr\u00e1rio de um coelhinho rec\u00e9m-nascido, que geralmente \u00e9 cego e sem pelos.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-755f-940a-880688e49143","description":"Um filhote de lebre","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-78ac-b1e9-4298d1793f2a","description":"Um filhote de ma\u00e7\u00e3","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-7c84-8e10-371779fbade8","description":"Um filhote de veado","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-758e-9c58-c43f1decad62","description":"Uma larva","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-7426-8eda-162853fca62d","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Como voc\u00ea chamaria uma abelha macho?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Um zang\u00e3o \u00e9 uma abelha macho. Ao contr\u00e1rio das abelhas oper\u00e1rias, os zang\u00f5es n\u00e3o coletam p\u00f3len nem possuem ferr\u00f5es.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-7ee8-b0f6-ed8f757bc73a","description":"Um zang\u00e3o","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-7db3-9eb4-37b832e57b35","description":"Um veado macho","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-7d62-8