6-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual osso N\u00c3O faz parte do cr\u00e2nio humano?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Os ossos do carpo formam o punho; os ossos occipital e temporal fazem parte do cr\u00e2nio, enquanto a maxila forma a mand\u00edbula superior.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-7542-b78a-1ed9afe12391","description":"Carpal","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-7eb9-874c-b33dfcb5d2bf","description":"Occipital","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-75c8-b002-eb8c75bc5e8b","description":"Temporal","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-7e41-b005-bbb78c720815","description":"Maxila","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-7689-aa82-ca07c4bc9dae","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual elemento est\u00e1 faltando na alimenta\u00e7\u00e3o quando ocorre o b\u00f3cio?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"O iodo \u00e9 necess\u00e1rio para a produ\u00e7\u00e3o dos horm\u00f4nios da tireoide; uma defici\u00eancia pode causar o aumento do volume da gl\u00e2ndula tireoide, formando um b\u00f3cio.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-7073-85bc-8efb27ff307d","description":"Iodo","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-7b4a-b57e-bbba9c274182","description":"Pot\u00e1ssio","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-790e-b98c-59bdd3dab4fc","description":"Cloro","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-7889-9f7d-288341d438c4","description":"Ferro","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-75a3-9e77-ffebfb8c28f2","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual prote\u00edna \u00e9 respons\u00e1vel pelo transporte de oxig\u00eanio no sangue?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"A hemoglobina cont\u00e9m grupos heme que cont\u00eam ferro e se ligam ao oxig\u00eanio de forma revers\u00edvel, conferindo aos gl\u00f3bulos vermelhos sua cor.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-799c-a68a-b64c3e92aff9","description":"Hemoglobina","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae0d-7da7-9104-9cda903ebe5e","desc